  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a variational gate‑based quantum neural network (LEP‑QNN) with angle encoding, RX/RY layers, and CNOT entanglement using 6 qubits and circuit depth 5. On a Kaggle loan‑eligibility dataset (614 train, 367 test), the model achieves 98% accuracy with the Adam optimizer, outperforming several reported classical baselines (e.g., 87.26% ensemble, 86.2% extra trees). Experiments are conducted on simulators with additional noise‑model robustness analysis.",
